NOTES.md
scratch/

# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# config.js is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It holds the Supabase project URL and the "anon public" key, both of
# which are meant to live in the browser — every visitor downloads them
# anyway. Row Level Security is what protects the data.
#
# What must never be committed is a service_role key or any other
# secret. If you ever add one, put it in a file named below and keep it
# out of the repo.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
secrets.js
.env
.env.*
